+{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdMJz3yumzN5tm8GaJRgr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TFbzsxnafT9Z3wMUYRjv2S","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/README.md","content":"# Document Management API\n\nExpress + TypeScript document manager with hierarchical folders, granular sharing and an\nactivity log. All state lives in memory and is created per app instance, so it resets on\nrestart (and every test gets a clean world).\n\n```bash\nnpm start          # http://localhost:3000\nnpm run build && npm run lint && npm test\n```\n\n`createApp()` is exported from `src/app.ts` (and re-exported from `src/index.ts` /\n`src/server.ts`) and returns the Express app.\n\n## Routes\n\nEvery route is also served under an `/api` prefix.\n\n| Method | Path | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| POST | `/auth/register` (aliases `/register`, `/users`, `/signup`) | `{username, password}` → user + token |\n| POST | `/auth/login` (aliases `/login`) | → `{token, user}` |\n| GET | `/me` | current user |\n| POST | `/folders` | `{name, parentId?}` |\n| GET | `/folders` | folders you can read |\n| GET | `/folders/:id` | folder plus readable `children` and `documents` |\n| PATCH·PUT | `/folders/:id` | rename / move (editor) |\n| DELETE | `/folders/:id` | owner only; deletes the whole subtree |\n| GET | `/folders/:id/children`, `/folders/:id/documents` | listings |\n| POST | `/documents`, `/folders/:folderId/documents` | `{title, content?, folderId?}` |\n| GET | `/documents`, `/documents/:id` | |\n| PATCH·PUT | `/documents/:id` | `{title?, content?, folderId?}` |\n| DELETE | `/documents/:id` | owner only |\n| POST | `/documents/:id/share`, `/folders/:id/share`, `/share` | `{userId\\|username, role}` |\n| GET | `/documents/:id/permissions`, `/folders/:id/permissions` | direct shares + effective roles |\n| DELETE | `/documents/:id/share/:userId`, `/folders/:id/share/:userId` | revoke (owner only) |\n| GET | `/activity` | filters: `resourceId`, `resourceType`, `userId`, `action`, `limit` |\n\nAuthenticate with `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.\n\n## Permission model\n\nRoles are ordered `viewer < editor < owner`:\n\n- **viewer** — read.\n- **editor** — read, modify, and share (up to editor).\n- **owner** — everything, including deletion and role management.\n\nThe creator of a folder or document is permanently its owner. Access flows *down* the folder\ntree: a share on a folder applies to every nested folder and document. When several paths\ngrant access — a direct share plus one or more inherited ones — the **most permissive** role\nwins, so a weaker direct share never shrinks a stronger inherited one\n(`src/permissions.ts:effectiveRole`).\n\nStatus codes: `401` when the token is missing or invalid, `403` when authenticated but\nunder-privileged, `404` for unknown resources, `400` for invalid payloads, `409` for a taken\nusername, `204` for deletes.\n\n## Layout\n\n```\nsrc/\n  app.ts           createApp(): wiring, error handling\n  index.ts         exports + CLI entry point\n  store.ts         in-memory Maps, password hashing, activity log\n  permissions.ts   role algebra, inheritance, subtree helpers\n  http.ts          HttpError, auth middleware, body parsing helpers\n  routes/          auth, folders, documents, share, activity\ntests/api.test.ts  26 supertest cases\n```\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":388,"cache_read_input_tokens":61802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":388},"output_tokens":56,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d21ad437-1159-4cef-bc4d-609a6e1da7e9","uuid":"91ff6efe-9c51-4f96-ac37-43d12aa8b665","request_id":"req_011CdMJz2eJAPFXJBRjeysiJ"}
